  "description": "A-Jin has the ability to see a person’s past lives when their lips touch. Having just turned twenty, A-Jin happens to meet Jin-U at a club. As Jin-U actively tries to seduce him, A-Jin gradually begins to develop special feelings for him. However, there’s one thing A-Jin won’t allow Jin-U to do: kiss him...\n\n *“I’m going to seduce you starting right now... Do you mind?”*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
